<Base title={"Therapist in Orem, UT | Avg $25/Session With Insurance | Tangible Therapy"} description={"Talk to your actual therapist before booking — free 15-minute consult. Orem counseling for anxiety, EMDR, couples & teens. Most insurance, avg $25/session."}>
<section class="sec t-white h-custom">
