<span style="font-size:15px;">9:00 am – 5:00 pm</span>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;">
<span style="font-size:15px;font-weight:500;">Saturday – Sunday</span>
<span style="font-size:15px;color:#7d867f;font-style:italic;">Closed</span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding-top:4px;">
<span id="tt-hours-dot" style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#b4b2a6;flex:none;"></span>
<span id="tt-hours-status" style="font-size:13px;color:#6b746e;">Currently closed</span>
</div>
</div>
<script is:inline>
(function () {
  var mt = new Date(new Date().toLocaleString('en-US', { timeZone: 'America/Denver' }));
  var open = mt.getDay() >= 1 && mt.getDay() <= 5 && mt.getHours() >= 9 && mt.getHours() < 17;
  if (open) {
    document.getElementById('tt-hours-dot').style.background = '#4a7a63';
    document.getElementById('tt-hours-status').textContent = 'Open now';
  }
})();
</script></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/2/14/10;--m:2/2/7/10"><div class="rte"><h1>Therapy in Orem, Utah: Where Healing Happens</h1></div></div>
  <div class="b b-code" style="--d:3/11/14/19;--m:11/2/24/10;--dz:7;--mz:7"><iframe allowfullscreen="" height="500" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2585.4409745479506!2d-111.69947356221591!3d40.301901520460746!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x874d7b22cbf956e1%3A0xe4b0052dd6b625ee!2sTangible%20Therapy!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1788466458823!5m2!1sen!2sus" style="border:0;" width="370"></iframe></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:14/2/16/7;--m:8/2/10/10;--dz:6;--mz:6"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-medium btn-full" href="tel:4352605406">Call Us</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:15/11/16/19;--m:25/2/27/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="rte"><h4 class="ta-center">246 N Orem Blvd. Orem, UT 84057</h4></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-light h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:18;--mrows:27">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/2/8/12;--m:1/2/4/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h2>Come Join us at Tangible Therapy Orem</h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:3/15/19/26;--m:20/2/27/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/chatgpt-image-apr-28-2026-10-46-19-am-921597.jpg" alt="" width="1402" height="1122" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:8/2/19/12;--m:4/2/20/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>Finding the right therapist in Orem shouldn't be hard. At Tangible Therapy, we've built a practice where skilled, evidence-based care is actually accessible to real people, with real schedules, and real insurance plans.</p><p>Our Orem office at 246 N Orem Blvd is home to a team of licensed therapists trained in EMDR, Gottman Method couples therapy, IFS, CBT, and more. Whether you're navigating anxiety, relationship challenges, trauma, or depression, we have a therapist who specializes in exactly what you're working through.</p><p>We're proud to be Utah Valley's most recognized therapy practice — named Best Counseling Center of Utah Valley two years running and Best of State Utah 2025. But what we're most proud of is helping people in Orem and across Utah County actually feel better.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

