<section class="sec t-bright-inverse h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:19;--mrows:34">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:2/15/6/25;--m:1/2/4/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h2>Insurance We Accept at Our Orem Office</h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:3/4/20/13;--m:21/2/35/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/chatgpt-image-may-13-2026-08-03-02-pm-058a89.jpg" alt="" width="1024" height="1536" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/15/17/25;--m:4/2/17/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>We're in-network with most major Utah insurance plans. Here's what we currently accept:</p><ul><li><p>Select Health</p></li><li><p>PEHP</p></li><li><p>EMI Health</p></li><li><p>DMBA</p></li><li><p>BlueCross BlueShield</p></li><li><p>Aetna</p></li><li><p>United Healthcare / UMR</p></li><li><p>Optum</p></li><li><p>Tricare</p></li></ul></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:17/15/20/25;--m:17/2/21/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="rte"><p>Not sure if your plan is covered? Call us at 435-260-5406 or send a message, and we'll verify your benefits before your first appointment, no surprises.</p></div></div>
