<section class="sec t-light h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:19;--mrows:29">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:2/2/6/12;--m:1/2/4/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h2>Serving Orem and All of Utah County</h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/14/20/26;--m:23/2/30/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/chatgpt-image-may-13-2026-08-15-59-pm-76d152.jpg" alt="" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/2/18/12;--m:4/2/19/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>Our Orem office is centrally located at 246 N Orem Blvd, with easy access and free parking. We see clients from across Utah County and the greater Wasatch Front, including:</p><ul><li><p>Orem</p></li><li><p>Provo</p></li><li><p>Lindon</p></li><li><p>Vineyard</p></li><li><p>Pleasant Grove</p></li><li><p>American Fork</p></li><li><p>Springville</p></li><li><p>Spanish Fork</p></li><li><p>Lehi</p></li><li><p>Highland</p></li></ul></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:18/2/20/12;--m:19/2/22/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="rte"><p>Not nearby? We offer telehealth therapy to anyone in Utah, so distance is never a barrier to getting the support you need.</p></div></div>
</div>
